<title>JAPAN: Kawasumi sets terms on Y40 bln convertible.</title>
<headline>Kawasumi sets terms on Y40 bln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Kawasumi Laboratories</p>
<p>Inc</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT    4 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON   0.0 pct     ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 14.Nov.00</p>
<p>CONV PRICE 1,312 yen CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 28.Nov.96  CONV TO  7.Nov.00</p>
